\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">baseline,     type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">probabilistic,    probabilistic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">sampling_percentage</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">send_batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8192</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">send_batch_max_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">timeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">200ms</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata_keys</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tenant.id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  otlp/overseas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">endpoint</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"otel-gw.example.com:4317\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  pipelines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    traces</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      receivers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      processors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">memory_limiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">resourcedetection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">k8sattributes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">transform/normalize</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">redaction</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">tail_sampling</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">batch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      exporters</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">otlp/overseas</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这条模板里有几处是针对跨境业务的<strong>真实约束</strong>，不是通用最佳实践：</p>\n<p><strong>脱敏必须回报被屏蔽的键。</strong> <code>redaction</code> processor 的失败模式是<strong>默认关闭（fail-closed）</strong>：若既没设 <code>allowed_keys</code> 也没开 <code>allow_all_keys</code>，它会<strong>把所有属性删光</strong>。这是为隐私设计的有意选择，但对业务是灾难性的静默。所以生产环境要么显式声明允许列表，要么用 <code>blocked_key_patterns</code> 做黑名单式屏蔽，并把 <code>summary</code> 设成 <code>debug</code> 让被屏蔽的键名出现在日志里——否则你无法证明「出境的数据里真的没有手机号」。</p>\n<p><strong>多租户分桶用 <code>metadata_keys</code>，且要盯基数。</strong> 跨境平台常见「一个 collector 服务多个国家站点」的部署，<code>batch</code> 的 <code>metadata_keys: [tenant.id]</code> 能让不同租户各自攒批，避免某一租户的慢链路拖累另一个租户的出口延迟。代价是每个 key 组合维护一个 batcher，默认基数上限 1000，超过就退化——用 <code>otelcol_processor_batch_metadata_cardinality</code> 盯住它。</p>\n<p><strong>采样决策要在合规脱敏之后，但在业务聚合之前。</strong> 如果 <code>spanmetrics</code> connector 还想按卡组织 / 支付方式出 RED 指标，<code>redaction</code> 就不能摘掉那些字段，而应只屏蔽真正的个人信息字段（<code>card_last4</code> 属于弱标识，是否保留取决于 PCI-DSS 的解读）。这里没有脱离业务语境的「标准答案」，只有一条纪律：<strong>脱敏规则和下游聚合规则必须一起评审</strong>，因为原地改写让两者在数据上互相耦合。</p>\n<p><strong><code>transform</code> 用 OTTL 做归一化，位置在富化之后、脱敏之前。</strong> 跨境链路里多区域 SDK 打点字段命名常不一致（有的写 <code>http.status_code</code>，有的写 <code>http.response.status_code</code>），先在 <code>transform</code> 里统一成一套语义约定，后面所有 filter / redaction 规则才只需要写一份；反过来先脱敏再归一化，filter 就要为每种命名各写一套条件。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>顺序即语义。</strong> <code>processors:</code> 列表的书写顺序就是执行顺序，官方不做任何隐式重排，同名 processor 在一条管道里不得重复。</li>\n<li><strong>每管道一份实例。</strong> processor 与 receiver/exporter 的实例语义相反：前者每管道独立、状态不共享，后者跨管道共享单实例。改了一处引用不等于改了全部。</li>\n<li><strong>就地改写、无回滚。</strong> 属性一旦被删除，下游再也看不到；顺序设计的第一步是列出「下游还要用哪些字段」。</li>\n<li><strong>端点定序。</strong> <code>memory_limiter</code> 放最前（背压尽早传导，软限 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">=</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span></span></span></span> <code>limit_mib</code> − <code>spike_limit_mib</code>），<code>batch</code> 放最后（攒批发生在所有丢数据操作之后）。</li>\n<li><strong><code>tail_sampling</code> 挑位置。</strong> 必须在 batch 之前，且必须看到同一 trace 的全部 span——靠 <code>routing</code> connector 或按 <code>traceID</code> 分片来保证；内存驻留 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>traces</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>S</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover><mtext>trace</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M \\approx N_{\\text{traces}} \\times \\bar{S}_{\\text{trace}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">traces</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9701em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8201em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trace</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>跨境场景两个专属约束。</strong> 脱敏默认 fail-closed（不配 allowlist 会删光属性），必须显式配置并把 <code>summary</code> 打开以证明出境数据干净；多租户靠 <code>batch.metadata_keys</code> 分桶，但要盯 <code>otelcol_processor_batch_metadata_cardinality</code> 的基数。</li>\n<li><strong>联动评审。</strong> 脱敏规则与下游聚合（如 <code>spanmetrics</code> connector）在数据上耦合，必须一起评审，不能各自演进。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>管道内定序解决的是「同一信号内怎么排」。当一条管道需要把数据交给另一条管道（比如从 spans 生成 metrics，或按租户分流转发）时，接力的载体是 connector——它的实例语义和 processor 截然不同，见 <a href=\"connector-pipeline-bridge\">connector 与管道接力：跨信号与跨管道的边界</a>；处理器引用的属性字段从哪来、OTLP 数据模型里 span/metric/log 各自的字段布局如何，是本文所有 OTTL 条件的前提，见 <a href=\"../otlp-protocol-data-model/otlp-transport-grpc-http-encoding\">OTLP 数据模型与信号语义</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"processor 家族语义与管道内处理顺序","id":"processor-家族语义与管道内处理顺序"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"顺序即语义：三条不可协商的铁律","id":"顺序即语义-三条不可协商的铁律"},{"level":3,"text":"铁律一：列表顺序 = 执行顺序，且无隐式重排","id":"铁律一-列表顺序-执行顺序-且无隐式重排"},{"level":3,"text":"铁律二：每条管道一份独立实例","id":"铁律二-每条管道一份独立实例"},{"level":3,"text":"铁律三：就地改写，没有回滚","id":"铁律三-就地改写-没有回滚"},{"level":2,"text":"首尾定序：memory_limiter 打头、batch 收尾","id":"首尾定序-memory_limiter-打头-batch-收尾"},{"level":2,"text":"尾采样的位置约束与内存预算","id":"尾采样的位置约束与内存预算"},{"level":2,"text":"跨境电商多租户与合规的定序模板","id":"跨境电商多租户与合规的定序模板"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"OTLP receiver 接收路径、批处理与 partial success 语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/opentelemetry-collector-pipeline-internals-otlp/otlp-protocol-data-model/otlp-receiver-batch-partial-success"},"next":{"title":"扩展框架与 Connector 桥接机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/opentelemetry-collector-pipeline-internals-otlp/processing-extension-custom/extension-framework-connector-bridge"}}